# Tailwind CSS & Styling Guidelines

## Design System Colors (shadcn/ui Dark Theme)
- Background: `bg-background` for main backgrounds
- Foreground: `text-foreground` for primary text
- Muted: `bg-muted/30` for subtle backgrounds, `text-muted-foreground` for secondary text
- Primary: `bg-primary`, `text-primary` for accent colors
- Secondary: `bg-secondary`, `text-secondary` for secondary elements
- Border: `border-border` for consistent borders
- Card: `bg-card`, `text-card-foreground` for card backgrounds

## Layout Patterns
- Container: Use `container mx-auto px-6` for consistent spacing
- Sections: Use `py-20` for section spacing
- Flexbox layouts: `flex`, `flex-col`, `items-center`, `justify-center`
- Grid layouts: `grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8` for responsive grids
- Spacing: Use `space-y-4`, `space-y-6`, `space-y-8` for consistent vertical spacing

## Component Styling Patterns (shadcn/ui)
- Cards: Use `Card` and `CardContent` components with `border-0 shadow-lg`
- Buttons: Use shadcn/ui `Button` with variants: `default`, `ghost`, `outline`, `secondary`
- Badges: Use shadcn/ui `Badge` with variants: `default`, `secondary`, `outline`
- Hover effects: Use `hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300`
- Group effects: Use `group` and `group-hover:` for interactive elements

## Typography
- Font weights: `font-bold` for main headings, `font-semibold` for section headings, `font-medium` for subheadings
- Text sizes: `text-4xl lg:text-6xl` for hero titles, `text-3xl lg:text-4xl` for section titles, `text-lg` for descriptions
- Text colors: `text-foreground` for primary, `text-muted-foreground` for secondary
- Line height: Use `leading-tight`, `leading-relaxed` for better readability

## Interactive Elements
- Use shadcn/ui Button component with proper variants
- Hover states: Built into shadcn/ui components with `hover:` utilities
- Focus states: Automatically handled by shadcn/ui components
- Transitions: Use `transition-all duration-300` for smooth animations

## Responsive Design
- Mobile-first approach with responsive prefixes: `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:`, `xl:`, `2xl:`
- Use `max-w-4xl`, `max-w-6xl` for content containers
- Responsive text: `text-4xl lg:text-6xl` for scalable typography
- Responsive grids: `grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3`

## Dark Theme Specific
- Use semantic color classes instead of hardcoded colors
- Ensure proper contrast with `text-foreground` and `text-muted-foreground`
- Use `bg-muted/30` for subtle background variations
- Apply `border-border` for consistent border colors